# x402-demo: single-file FastEndpoints app with x402 payments.
# Start (from this folder): dotnet run app.cs  (port and X402:* settings come from app.run.json;
# X402:PayTo must be set, e.g. in app.run.local.json, for real payments)
@host = http://localhost:5000
# Base64 payment payload signed by the payer's wallet for the requirements in the
# PAYMENT-REQUIRED header of the 402 response (the test page at "/" builds it).
@paymentSignature =

### Browser test page (HTML; pays with MetaMask)
GET {{host}}/

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Protected resource without payment (expect 402 + PAYMENT-REQUIRED header)
GET {{host}}/x402/premium

### Protected resource with a payment payload (set @paymentSignature first)
GET {{host}}/x402/premium
PAYMENT-SIGNATURE: {{paymentSignature}}
